	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[grant (suite)]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=25396#p25396"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Je fais :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>revoke all privileges on all tables in schema sync from generic_user;
grant all privileges on all tables in schema sync to generic_user with grant option;</code></pre></div><p>Dans le passé, j&#039;avais fait</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>grant generic user to daniel</code></pre></div><p>Et quand, je fais </p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>psql dev_contacts_server daniel
delete from sync.log;</code></pre></div><p>Je reçois</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>ERROR:  permission denied for schema sync
LINE 1: delete from sync.log;</code></pre></div><p>Je ne comprends pas... Que faire ?</p>]]></content>
